Package: ptcompare
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian Multiscale Two-Sample Comparison
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Naoki", "Awaya", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "nawaya@waseda.jp")
Description: Bayesian comparison of two multivariate distributions using
    hidden Markov Polya trees with adaptive partitions, following Awaya and
    Ma (2024) <doi:10.1080/01621459.2022.2105223>. Provides posterior evidence
    for overall differences, interpretable partition trees, local effect
    sizes and computational diagnostics. Posterior computation combines
    sequential Monte Carlo and recursive message passing.
URL: https://github.com/nawaya040/ptcompare
BugReports: https://github.com/nawaya040/ptcompare/issues
License: GPL (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: Rcpp, graphics, grDevices, stats, utils
LinkingTo: Rcpp
